  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICZM Kihnu Strait</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICZM Kihnu Strait</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med insatsen &#xE4;r att utbilda regionala- och lokala tj&#xE4;nstem&#xE4;n i &quot;Integrated Coastal Zone Management&quot; i ett expansivt och ur milj&#xF6;- synpunkt k&#xE4;nsligt och v&#xE4;rdefullt omr&#xE5;de p&#xE5; den estniska v&#xE4;stkusten. ICZM fokuserar p&#xE5; milj&#xF6;problem i kombination med &#xF6;kad f&#xF6;retag- samhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to establish the process of Integrated Coastal Zone Management in an expansive and environmental sensitive area and to adopt a plan that promotes sustainable develop- ment on local and regional level. The aim is to educate regional and local officials from the ICZM.</narrative>
  </description>
